 that before. So I went on about my business, and Lou went on about his. But Lou still tries to come around and make me think like he thinks. It'll never happen. It hasn't happened all these years. So it'll never happen, baby. No, baby, they can take that gay mess and keep it to themselves. God bless 'em.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q3279$1BFEA4D5-6F65-415A-993F-C67F1DBF8B15", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "34764ef3d0ba818cf6d40542cab281dffffb3e51", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/27edda13f5009bfcf57e93ca59d633b8/821.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q3279$FBA90908-15DB-4656-9B29-F59EF533434D", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "9086e6e28c1a6350924cdddc10b23d415aea29c6", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 87, "id": "Q87"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q3279$72CE39E4-5592-40AB-BA37-4F9B42F61FC2", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "ee9e1f728416d457858ef8ce0cdb804ecd5517b0", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 86, "id": "Q86"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q3279$092F9751-8993-40D7-AC29-97A441A7142F", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "dd928deaa90cbf784de38bdcd5c32d39b4ee5322", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 86, "id": "Q86"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q3279$9A63A325-BFC3-424B-873C-BD86DF37D00D", "rank": "normal"}]}}